app: php:8.3-cli que instala extensões necessárias (pdo_sqlite, mbstring, zip, bcmath), roda composer install, aplica migrations no sqlite existente e sobe php artisan serve na porta 8000.
npm: node:22-alpine que roda npm install e npm run dev (Vite com HMR) na porta 5173.
